## storeState (body-1)

JSON-stringifies the supplied space-to-item-array object into messenger.xhtml/unifiedToolbar/state, then synchronously calls notifyObservers for unified-toolbar-state-change. It returns undefined after those calls. Serialization or service failure propagates and can prevent notification; there is no rollback, validation, promise or flush wait.

- reads: state argument and three key constants.
- writes: Writes JSON to the XUL-store key, then notifies observers.
- branches: No conditional; notification follows storage call.
- result: undefined after synchronous calls return.
- errors: JSON.stringify errors or setValue errors propagate before notification; notification errors propagate after the stored write. No rollback.
- async: Synchronous; no promise, scheduling or cancellation operation in this body.
- ownership: Module state and local allocations are distinguished in writes; ownership is not transferred by a plain return except for returned fresh arrays/objects.

